          "text": "Back range of motion"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Flexion and extension decreased due to pain and stiffness; able to flex to mid-shin."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-19",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-19",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Lower limb neurological examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Lower limb power approximately 4+/5 symmetrically, described as sarcopenic. Patellar and ankle reflexes present and symmetrical. Light touch slightly decreased in both feet, same as previously. Straight leg raise negative bilaterally."
      }
    },
    {
